            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona Nebuzaradani mkpwulu wa arindzi a mfalume wahala Seraya mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, Zefania msaidiziwe, na arindzi a maryango ahahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula mo mudzini wahala ofisaa mmwenga yekala mkpwulu wa vikosi vya jeshi, atu atsano okala ashauri a mfalume, piya wahala muandishi wa mkpwulu wa jeshi yekala achiandikisha atu, phamwenga na atu mirongo sita ambao waakuta mo mudzini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebuzaradani mkpwulu wa arindzi waahala atu hinyo, achiaphirika kpwa mfalume wa Babeli hiko Ribula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume Nebukadineza wa Babeli walagiza atu aha apigbwe na aolagbwe hiko Ribula kahi za tsi ya Hamathi. Kpwa hivyo atu a Juda atsamizwa achendakala atumwa kondze ya tsi yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
