              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.40.7+JER.40.8+JER.40.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jeremia 40:7–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nebukadineza, mfalume wa Babeli wamtsambula Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, mdzukulu wa Shafani, kukala liwali wa atu osi a Juda ambao taayaphirikpwa Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona akulu osi a majeshi phamwenga na atu aho ariphosikira kukala mfalume wa Babeli kala akatsambula Gedalia kukala mtawala, amlunga Gedalia hiko Mizipa. Atu hinyo kala ni Isimaili mwana wa Nethania, Johanani mwana wa Karea, Seraya mwana wa Tanihumethi kula mudzi wa Netofa na Jaazania kula Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedalia waapira aho na vikosi vyao achiamba, “Msiogophe kpwa sababu ya akulu a Ababeli. Sagalani mumu tsini na mumuhumikire mfalume wa Babeli na mambo genu gandakuphihiranito.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.41.1+JER.41.2+JER.41.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jeremia 41:1–3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mwezi wa sabaa, Isimaili mwana wa Nethania, mwana wa Elishama, ariyekala wa chivyazi cha chifalume, wakpwedza kpwa Gedalia phamwenga na atu kumi, amuolaga Gedalia na upanga. Piya waaolaga Ayahudi na Ababeli ambao kala a phamwenga naye hiko Mizipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5+JER.43.6+JER.43.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jeremia 43:5–7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu, Aiziraeli osi, enye vyeo na atu a kawaida phamwenga na akulu a majeshi aunuka, achiphiya Misiri, kpwa sababu aogopha Ababeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa mirongo mihahu na sabaa bada ya Jehoyakini, mfalume wa Juda kuhalwa mateka, Evili-Merodaki wakala mfalume wa Babeli. Iye wamrichira Jehoyakini, mfalume wa Juda kula jela siku ya mirongo miiri na sabaa ya mwezi wa kumi na mbiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evili-Merodaki wamuonera mbazi na achimupha cheo cha dzulu kuriko afalume anjina ariokala ko Babeli phamwenga naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jehoyakini wavula nguwo za jela achibadilisha. Naye achikala anarya mezani pha mfalume maishage gosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila siku wahewa posho ni mfalume wa Babeli kulengana na mahitajige.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
